WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.526
Finally, an automation.

00:00:01.526 --> 00:00:06.625
I give it a name, pick a weekly
trigger, and describe the job:

00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:11.330
every Monday, get new data, rebuild
the website, the workbook, and the

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.291
briefing, and summarize what changed.

00:00:13.291 --> 00:00:16.428
Set it up once, and it keeps running.
